OL,3,GNEWSAHow is climate change affecting
OL,4,ABristol's trees?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOur oldest trees are increasingly
OL,7,Fvulnerable to disease, extreme weather
OL,8,Fand the effects of climate change.
OL,10,FThe collapse of a 166-year-old copper
OL,11,Fbeech in Bristol's Victoria Square,
OL,12,Fwhich was already scheduled for
OL,13,Fremoval, has raised questions about the
OL,14,Ffuture of the city's landmark trees.
OL,16,FScientists warn that there is
OL,17,Fadditional pressure on mature trees,
OL,18,Fwith damage to their roots potentially
OL,19,Fleaving them vulnerable to falling.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
