OL,3,GNEWSAHow is climate change affecting
OL,4,ABristol's trees?
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessor Andy Bailey, an expert in
OL,7,Fmolecular mycology, said: "Trees just
OL,8,Fcan't change quickly to adapt to
OL,9,Fclimate change."
